  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Mhantesh Basavraj Bhavi vs State Of Maharashtra on 21 December, 2023 Author: N.J.Jamadar Bench: N.J.Jamadar 906 aba 3581 of 2023. In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Criminal Appellate Jurisdiction Anticipatory Bail Application No.3581 Of 2023 Mhantesh Basavraj Bhavi ... Applicant versus The State of Maharashtra ... Respondent Sumit Kothari, for Applicant. Smt. Ashwini Takalkar, App for State. Coram: N.J.Jamadar, J. Date : 21 December 2023 P.C. 1. 2. This is an application for pre-arrest bail in connection with C.R.No.460 of 2023 registered with Akkalkot North Police Station for the offences punishable under Sections 328, 188, 272 and 273 of the Indian Penal Code and Sections 26(2)(i), 26(2)(v), 26(2)(ii), 27(3)(e) and 59 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. 3. The applicant apprehends arrest in connection with the aforesaid crime as the co-accused in whose possession the contraband articles - Gutakha Pan masala, has been seized, has named the applicant as the alleged supplier of the contraband articles.",
    "facts": "2. This is an application for pre-arrest bail in connection with C.R.No.460 of 2023 registered with Akkalkot North Police Station for the offences punishable under Sections 328, 188, 272 and 273 of the Indian Penal Code and Sections 26(2)(i), 26(2)(v), 26(2)(ii), 27(3)(e) and 59 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. 3. The applicant apprehends arrest in connection with the aforesaid crime as the co-accused in whose possession the contraband articles - Gutakha Pan masala, has been seized, has named the applicant as the alleged supplier of the contraband articles.",
